Description: cross-platform desktop time tracker with CouchDB-ready SQLite storage
 NapTimer is an NAppGUI port of gtimer. It tracks time by task with
 daily totals, projects, tags, annotations, reports, and a CLI. All app
 data is stored as JSON documents in a single SQLite docs table.
